    "wacc_rationale": "USD flows, USD rate. Risk-free ~4.3% (10y UST), ERP 5.0%, levered beta ~1.1 -> cost of equity ~9.8%; after-tax cost of debt ~4.0% at ~6% debt/EV weight (6.9bn debt vs ~73bn market cap) -> WACC ~9.4%, rounded to 9.0% because cyclicality is priced in the scenario flows (bear includes a post-pre-buy truck trough) and must not be charged again in the rate. Same WACC in all three scenarios (risk charged once).",
    "lease_treatment": "US GAAP ASC 842: operating lease cost already sits inside operating expenses and hence inside EBITDA; operating lease liabilities (562m at FY2025) excluded from net debt. Treatment (B), charged once; no separate lease_cost_pct_path.",
